#: src/Admin/SpaceTotals.php:65
msgid "Two figures, kept apart on purpose: what the unused files are holding now, and what deleting them has actually freed so far. Both are measured from the files themselves — the same size shown against each file in the table above — and count the original file only, so the disk a deletion really frees is larger than the number here, never smaller."
